  ["Mental Quickness (2 puntos)"] = "Mental Quickness (2 points)",
  ["Mental Strength (5 puntos) · clave"] = "Mental Strength (5 points) · key",
  ["Mientras Aspect of the Hawk está activo, Auto Shot tiene un 2/4/6/8/10% de probabilidad de aumentar un 30% la velocidad de ataque a distancia durante 12 s. Mientras Aspect of the Beast está activo, todos los ataques automáticos cuerpo a cuerpo tienen un 2/4/6/8/10% de probabilidad de aumentar un 30% la velocidad de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo durante 12 s."] = "While Aspect of the Hawk is active, Auto Shot has a 2/4/6/8/10% chance of increasing ranged attack speed by 30% for 12 s. While Aspect of the Beast is active, all melee auto attacks have a 2/4/6/8/10% chance of increasing melee attack speed by 30% for 12 s.",
  ["Mientras Righteous Fury está activo todo el daño recibido se reduce un 3/6/9%."] = "While Righteous Fury is active, all damage taken is reduced by 3/6/9%.",
  ["Mientras estés en Bear Form, Cat Form, Dire Bear Form o Moonkin Form, obtienes 1/2/3 p. de armadura base por nivel y 0.67/1.33/2 p. más de armadura base por cada punto de tu habilidad de defensa por encima de cinco veces tu nivel. Los multiplicadores de estas formas aumentan aún más esta cantidad."] = "While in Bear Form, Cat Form, Dire Bear Form, or Moonkin Form, you gain 1/2/3 additional base Armor per level and another 0.67/1.33/2 base Armor for each point of defense skill beyond five times your level. This amount can be further increased by multipliers from those forms.",
  ["Mientras rastreas bestias, demonios, dragonantes, elementales, gigantes, humanoides o no-muertos, todo el daño que infliges al tipo de criatura rastreada aumenta un 1/2/3/4/5%."] = "While tracking Beasts, Demons, Dragonkin, Elementals, Giants, Humanoids, or Undead, all damage you deal to the tracked creature type is increased by 1/2/3/4/5%.",
  ["Mientras tu mascota está activa, tú y tu mascota regeneran un 1% de su salud total cada 10/5 s."] = "While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate 1% of total health every 10/5 sec.",
  ["Mind Blast. Talentos en Shadow (o Discipline para Wand Specialization)."] = "Mind Blast. Talents in Shadow (or Discipline for Wand Specialization).",
  ["Mindfulness (3 puntos)"] = "Mindfulness (3 points)",
  ["Mining + Herbalism (o Mining + Skinning) mientras subes; vendes todo en la casa de subastas."] = "Mining + Herbalism (or Mining + Skinning) while leveling; you sell everything on the auction house.",
  ["Mining + Herbalism mientras subes."] = "Mining + Herbalism while leveling.",
  ["Mining: hasta 150 picando las vetas de tu zona (fundir también da puntos)."] = "Mining: up to 150 by mining the veins in your area (smelting also gives points).",
