  ["Pásate a Restoration. Ve al entrenador de clase, paga el reajuste (1 oro la primera vez) y reparte tus 31 puntos así: Tidal Focus 5 · Mindfulness 3 · Improved Healing Wave 5 · Water Shield 1 · Healing Focus 1 · Mana Tide Totem 1 · Tidal Mastery 5 ·…"] = "Switch to Restoration. Go to your class trainer, pay the respec (1 gold the first time) and spend your 31 points like this: Tidal Focus 5 · Mindfulness 3 · Improved Healing Wave 5 · Water Shield 1 · Healing Focus 1 · Mana Tide Totem 1 · Tidal Mastery 5 ·…",
  ["Pásate a Subtlety. Ve al entrenador de clase, paga el reajuste (1 oro la primera vez) y reparte tus 31 puntos así: Master of Deception 3 · Opportunity 5 · Improved Ambush 3 · Premeditation 1 · Serrated Blades 3 · Ghostly Strike 1 · Dirty Deeds 2 ·…"] = "Switch to Subtlety. Go to your class trainer, pay the respec (1 gold the first time) and spend your 31 points like this: Master of Deception 3 · Opportunity 5 · Improved Ambush 3 · Premeditation 1 · Serrated Blades 3 · Ghostly Strike 1 · Dirty Deeds 2 ·…",
  ["Pásate a Survival. Ve al entrenador de clase, paga el reajuste (1 oro la primera vez) y reparte tus 31 puntos así: Lethal Attacks 5 · Improved Tracking 5 · Savage Strikes 2 · Survivalist 3 · Surefooted 3 · Clever Traps 2 · Predator's Edge 5 · Expose Prey 1…"] = "Switch to Survival. Go to your class trainer, pay the respec (1 gold the first time) and spend your 31 points like this: Lethal Attacks 5 · Improved Tracking 5 · Savage Strikes 2 · Survivalist 3 · Surefooted 3 · Clever Traps 2 · Predator's Edge 5 · Expose Prey 1…",
