  ["Rend and Tear: cambia su efecto"] = "Rend and Tear: effect changed",
  ["Rend se aplica siempre al empezar cada combate, así que mejorarlo sube tu daño."] = "Rend is always applied at the start of every fight, so improving it raises your damage.",
  ["Renew cura un poco más; lo tendrás activo casi siempre (tanque o tú)."] = "Renew heals a bit more; you will have it up almost always (tank or yourself).",
  ["Renew es tu cura instantánea y tu HoT al tanque: 15 % más gratis."] = "Renew is your instant heal and your HoT on the tank: 15% more for free.",
  ["Renewed Hope (5 puntos)"] = "Renewed Hope (5 points)",
  ["Requiere Bear Form y Dire Bear Form.\nCargas contra un enemigo, lo que lo inmoviliza e interrumpe el lanzamiento de todos los hechizos durante 4 s.\n\nFeral Charge (Cat): Salta y reaparece detrás de un enemigo."] = "Requires Bear Form and Dire Bear Form.\nCharge an enemy, immobilizing it and interrupting all spellcasting for 4 sec.\n\nFeral Charge (Cat): Leap behind an enemy.",
  ["Requiere Bear Form y Dire Bear Form.\nCargas contra un enemigo, lo que lo inmoviliza e interrumpe el lanzamiento de todos los hechizos durante 4 s.\n\nFeral Charge (Cat): Salta y reaparece detrás de un enemigo."] = "Requires Bear Form, Dire Bear Form.\nCharge an enemy, immobilizing them and interrupting any spell they are casting for 4 s.\n\nFeral Charge (Cat): Leap behind an enemy.",
  ["Resourcefulness (2 puntos)"] = "Resourcefulness (2 points)",
  ["Restablece 280 p. de salud al jugador objetivo y a todos los miembros de su grupo durante 7 s. Los miembros del grupo deben estar dentro de un radio de 43.5 m del jugador objetivo. La sanación se aplica rápidamente al principio y luego más lentamente a medida que el Wild Growth alcanza su duración máxima."] = "Heals the target and their party for 280 over 7 s. Party members must be within 43.5 yards of target. The amount healed is applied quickly at first, and slows down as Wild Growth reaches its full duration.",
  ["Restorative Totems (5 puntos)"] = "Restorative Totems (5 points)",
  ["Reverberation (5 puntos)"] = "Reverberation (5 points)",
  ["Reverence (3 puntos)"] = "Reverence (3 points)",
