  ["Sana 445 p. a un objetivo aliado durante 15 s y aumenta un 25% la efectividad de tu hechizo Chain Heal directo sobre ese objetivo."] = "Heals a friendly target for 445 over 15 s, and increases the effectiveness of your Chain Heal casts directly on that target by 25%.",
