  ["Tailoring de 150 a 225: Earthen Vest ×12 (153→163), Crimson Silk Vest ×13 (163→175), Crimson Silk Pantaloons ×5 (175→180), Orange Mageweave Shirt ×12 (180→190), Black Mageweave Vest ×7 (190→195) y 4 tramos más."] = "Tailoring from 150 to 225: Earthen Vest ×12 (153→163), Crimson Silk Vest ×13 (163→175), Crimson Silk Pantaloons ×5 (175→180), Orange Mageweave Shirt ×12 (180→190), Black Mageweave Vest ×7 (190→195) and 4 more steps.",
  ["Tailoring de 150 a 225: Invoker's Cord ×15 (175→185), Orange Martial Shirt ×12 (185→195), Lavender Mageweave Shirt ×7 (195→200), Pink Mageweave Shirt ×7 (200→205), Tuxedo Shirt ×7 (205→210) y 1 tramos más."] = "Tailoring from 150 to 225: Invoker's Cord ×15 (175→185), Orange Martial Shirt ×12 (185→195), Lavender Mageweave Shirt ×7 (195→200), Pink Mageweave Shirt ×7 (200→205), Tuxedo Shirt ×7 (205→210) and 1 more steps.",
